# Track-D Temporary Checkpoint — Exp38 through Exp42

Date: 2026-08-13

Purpose: compact temporary checkpoint for the current Track-D research sequence. It must later be folded into `docs/GOLD_DISCOVERY_HISTORY.md` and deleted. Historical OOS is repeatedly inspected; runtime promotion remains NONE; Exp27 remains untouched.

